Add Node Exporter to Prometheus

Open:

Shell
nano prometheus.yml

Add:

YAML
scrape_configs:
- job_name: 'prometheus'
static_configs:
- targets: ['localhost:9090']
 
- job_name: 'node-exporter'
static_configs:
- targets: ['192.168.11.150:9100']

Save:

Plain Text
Ctrl + O
Enter
Ctrl + X

Restart Prometheus:

Shell
docker restart prometheus
Verify Target

Open:

Plain Text
http://localhost:9090/targets

Expected:

Plain Text
prometheus UP
node-exporter UP
Then Create CPU Panel

Grafana → Add Visualization → Prometheus

Query:

PromQL
100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle"}[5m])) * 100)

Visualization:

Plain Text
Gauge

Title:

Plain Text
CPU Usage %
 
Create Memory Panel

Query:

PromQL
((node_memory_MemTotal_bytes - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes) * 100

Visualization:

Plain Text
Gauge

Title:

Plain Text
Memory Usage %
First run this command:
Shell
docker ps

and check whether node-exporter is running. If it is not listed, that's the root cause.

